+## Overview
+
+Total revenue across the dataset is $7,154.44 from 30 orders. The median order
+value is $204.94, while individual orders range from $47.50 to $598.00, so the
+book is spread fairly evenly rather than carried by a few large deals. Four
+products sell into four regions during May 2026.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget leads with $2,392.00, roughly a third of all revenue, helped by its
+$149.50 unit price. Widget follows at $2,118.94, driven by volume rather than
+price. Doohickey contributes $1,513.00 and Sprocket trails at $1,130.50. The top
+two products together account for about 63% of revenue.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North is the strongest region at $2,176.35 (about 30% of revenue). East follows
+with $1,830.79 and South with $1,732.48, leaving the two within roughly $100 of
+each other. West is last at $1,414.82, about 35% below North. The gap between
+best and worst region is $761.53, a meaningful spread given the small order
+count.
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Grow West, the weakest region at $1,414.82; closing half its gap to North adds roughly $380 in revenue.
+- Push Gadget harder: at $149.50 per unit it produces a third of revenue on few units.
+- Review Sprocket, the smallest line at $1,130.50, to see whether pricing or promotion explains the shortfall.
